# Loading Swap

A wrapper component that swaps content with a loading spinner while maintaining the component's dimensions to prevent layout shifts.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/loading-swap.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/loading-swap.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/loading-swap.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { LoadingSwap } from '@/registry/loading-swap'

const loading = ref(true)
</script>

<template>
  <LoadingSwap :is-loading="loading">
    <div>My loaded content</div>
  </LoadingSwap>
</template>
```

