### Registry dependencies

::deps{type="shadcn" :external="false" :dependencies='[{"text": "spinner"}]'}
::

### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `isLoading` | `boolean` | `undefined` | Toggle between content and loading spinner. |
| `className` | `string` | `undefined` | Additional CSS classes for both content and spinner wrappers. |

### Slots

| Slot | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `default` | The content to display when `isLoading` is false. |
